(2496914, 344415, 40370, '<td valign="top">Oh my, I must be getting slow tonight, that took me 15.7 seconds to figure out, thank goodness for titles. Nice imagination, beautiful color, but the brownish background colors are kind of unfavorable. Overall though you''ve displayed talent with this great set-up.</td>', 'Oh my, I must be getting slow tonight, that took me 15.7 seconds to figure out, thank goodness for titles. Nice imagination, beautiful color, but the brownish background colors are kind of unfavorable. Overall though you''ve displayed talent with this great set-up.', '2006-06-07 23:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
