(2498690, 341308, 3569, '<td valign="top">must be Kansas</td>', 'must be Kansas', '2006-06-08 13:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498699, 342482, 3569, '<td valign="top">don''t tell anyone,or you''ll lose it to the Government.  Nice interpretation.</td>', 'don''t tell anyone,or you''ll lose it to the Government.  Nice interpretation.', '2006-06-08 13:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498702, 344378, 27482, '<td valign="top">I dunno why, this has nothing to do with photography but seeing a cigarette and a baby in the same photo really bothers me, sorry, just had to get that off my chest.</td>', 'I dunno why, this has nothing to do with photography but seeing a cigarette and a baby in the same photo really bothers me, sorry, just had to get that off my chest.', '2006-06-08 13:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498723, 344254, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, could have been executed better though, why not let him hold something iconic that really implies that he is dead and gives a more sense of story to it, like a gun or an empty briefcase that looks like it´s ben busted open or something like that...</td>', 'Nice idea, could have been executed better though, why not let him hold something iconic that really implies that he is dead and gives a more sense of story to it, like a gun or an empty briefcase that looks like it´s ben busted open or something like that...', '2006-06-08 13:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498730, 341221, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and well captured, would have been even cooler though if the tires were not just so completely frozen, the image looks pretty static because of it, if the tires just had a hint of motion blur this would be so much more dynamic.  Anyway, nice shot, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Cool idea and well captured, would have been even cooler though if the tires were not just so completely frozen, the image looks pretty static because of it, if the tires just had a hint of motion blur this would be so much more dynamic.  Anyway, nice shot, gave it a 7.', '2006-06-08 13:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498748, 342919, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good one, I like the placement of the money, just in the corner, not in plain sight, just as you''d probably see it.</td>', 'Good one, I like the placement of the money, just in the corner, not in plain sight, just as you''d probably see it.', '2006-06-08 13:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498750, 342779, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, a little grainy but that doesn''t bother me too much.</td>', 'Nice composition, a little grainy but that doesn''t bother me too much.', '2006-06-08 13:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498754, 342022, 43774, '<td valign="top">Great close up. I am a little put off by the fact that only one eye is yellow, then again maybe that is what you are going for with the title of "Survivor"...does it even have another eye? A little mystery, not bad.</td>', 'Great close up. I am a little put off by the fact that only one eye is yellow, then again maybe that is what you are going for with the title of "Survivor"...does it even have another eye? A little mystery, not bad.', '2006-06-08 13:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498757, 343877, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good find, good capture, good composition. I''d say this is good!</td>', 'Good find, good capture, good composition. I''d say this is good!', '2006-06-08 13:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498758, 342659, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful close up, I''d be estatic if I found this!</td>', 'Wonderful close up, I''d be estatic if I found this!', '2006-06-08 13:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498767, 343521, 43774, '<td valign="top">Ha! This is too funny</td>', 'Ha! This is too funny', '2006-06-08 13:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498769, 344415, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute set up....can you save me the seeds? LOL Nicely photographed, good colours and very clear.</td>', 'Cute set up....can you save me the seeds? LOL Nicely photographed, good colours and very clear.', '2006-06-08 13:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498772, 343786, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, really pops.</td>', 'Good DOF, really pops.', '2006-06-08 13:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498820, 344038, 40921, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but might have found it a little more believable if he was a little grittier, and if he didn''t have that watch on. That is assuming you were trying show him as a homeless man.</td>', 'I like the shot, but might have found it a little more believable if he was a little grittier, and if he didn''t have that watch on. That is assuming you were trying show him as a homeless man.', '2006-06-08 14:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2498893, 342452, 51538, '<td valign="top">Like both the detail in the insect wings and the wood grain.  That''s a pleasing photo.</td>', 'Like both the detail in the insect wings and the wood grain.  That''s a pleasing photo.', '2006-06-08 14:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
