(2499013, 344511, 45004, '<td valign="top">I like the bench. My first thought is that I would like to have the light warmer in tone. I like the low angle you took the image at.</td>', 'I like the bench. My first thought is that I would like to have the light warmer in tone. I like the low angle you took the image at.', '2006-06-08 15:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499017, 343679, 45004, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure. I like the contrast the bird has with the background. I also like that it is in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Nice exposure. I like the contrast the bird has with the background. I also like that it is in B&W.', '2006-06-08 15:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499030, 344448, 45004, '<td valign="top">WOW. Very nice exposure and bright color. Nice as a landscape, but then the moose (? elk?) realy makes the shot. I love this one!</td>', 'WOW. Very nice exposure and bright color. Nice as a landscape, but then the moose (? elk?) realy makes the shot. I love this one!', '2006-06-08 15:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499047, 340968, 45004, '<td valign="top">Nice way to show the sky. I like the addition of the building and reflections.</td>', 'Nice way to show the sky. I like the addition of the building and reflections.', '2006-06-08 15:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499051, 343395, 45004, '<td valign="top">Looks like my families fridge.</td>', 'Looks like my families fridge.', '2006-06-08 15:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499064, 342682, 45004, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of lightning. I love the color of the sky. I hope you take care not to expose your self to high risks (such as no metal tripod and knowlage of weather). Very impressive amount ob bolts.</td>', 'Nice shot of lightning. I love the color of the sky. I hope you take care not to expose your self to high risks (such as no metal tripod and knowlage of weather). Very impressive amount ob bolts.', '2006-06-08 15:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499079, 342381, 45004, '<td valign="top">Do they last forever as well? I love the idea and the lighting showing the Twinkies name through the top.</td>', 'Do they last forever as well? I love the idea and the lighting showing the Twinkies name through the top.', '2006-06-08 15:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499104, 343190, 40667, '<td valign="top">Great tones!! Love the vibrancy of her skin, almost neon... well... okay, it''s neon. Nice shot! Only thing i wish was different would be the grass around the head... the head tends to get a bit lost. Nice shot!</td>', 'Great tones!! Love the vibrancy of her skin, almost neon... well... okay, it''s neon. Nice shot! Only thing i wish was different would be the grass around the head... the head tends to get a bit lost. Nice shot!', '2006-06-08 16:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499129, 342942, 45004, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections, the sky, the lights on the bridge. I also like the dappled warm light on the boat, but wish there was just a bit more on the wall or some thing.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the reflections, the sky, the lights on the bridge. I also like the dappled warm light on the boat, but wish there was just a bit more on the wall or some thing.  Nice shot.', '2006-06-08 16:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2499148, 343968, 9690, '<td valign="top">So very cool.  Great sharpness and timing.  Great job!  One of my favs so far!  ~10</td>', 'So very cool.  Great sharpness and timing.  Great job!  One of my favs so far!  ~10', '2006-06-08 16:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
