(2499165, 342656, 9690, '<td valign="top">Yeah, and those Runts do go bad after a while.  I worked in an office where they had been used for decorations in a jar.  After ten years, or so, they developed pits in thier exterior.  Very odd.</td>', 'Yeah, and those Runts do go bad after a while.  I worked in an office where they had been used for decorations in a jar.  After ten years, or so, they developed pits in thier exterior.  Very odd.', '2006-06-08 16:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
