(2500026, 341905, 59130, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why this family is "unexpected"?  Also - they don''t really look like a family in this shot - they look like 3 individuals - they are all looking in different directions and don''t seem very "together".  The light fitting on top of the child''s head is off-putting and the background generally isn''t great to look at.  The lighting is nice though!</td>', 'I don''t know why this family is "unexpected"?  Also - they don''t really look like a family in this shot - they look like 3 individuals - they are all looking in different directions and don''t seem very "together".  The light fitting on top of the child''s head is off-putting and the background generally isn''t great to look at.  The lighting is nice though!', '2006-06-08 21:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
