(2501119, 342817, 27482, '<td valign="top">Love the kid´s expression, notsomuch the grownups though, think he might have worked better with a less exaggarated expression but still bewildered.  Anyway, nice choice of DOF and I like the clarity in the image, nice image quality.  7 from me.</td>', 'Love the kid´s expression, notsomuch the grownups though, think he might have worked better with a less exaggarated expression but still bewildered.  Anyway, nice choice of DOF and I like the clarity in the image, nice image quality.  7 from me.', '2006-06-09 05:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501128, 342381, 27482, '<td valign="top">I don´t get it.  Perhaps the box is significant to you where you come from but for me, living somewhere else on this planet, this shot makes no sense to me.  I am guessing that is a box of a popular doughnut type though and so the vegetables don´t belong there or something.  Anyway, the shot is nice, pretty well lit but too dark for my taste, light is good, just could have been more of it, that´s all.  6 from me.</td>', 'I don´t get it.  Perhaps the box is significant to you where you come from but for me, living somewhere else on this planet, this shot makes no sense to me.  I am guessing that is a box of a popular doughnut type though and so the vegetables don´t belong there or something.  Anyway, the shot is nice, pretty well lit but too dark for my taste, light is good, just could have been more of it, that´s all.  6 from me.', '2006-06-09 05:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2501137, 341481, 27482, '<td valign="top">Looks like the shot could have been nice if the image quality was there, it´s too blurry for my taste.</td>', 'Looks like the shot could have been nice if the image quality was there, it´s too blurry for my taste.', '2006-06-09 05:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
