(2502339, 344003, 37719, '<td valign="top">Technically this is a good shot - nice and crisp, well composed and excellent color control.  The lighting is well done and the perspective is good as well.  However, if you had used a real hair or had a bug floating in the soup or even the spoon with soup and the hair/bug in it THAT would be unexpected.  Also, with the spoon off to the side and clean (as in obviously not used yet) doesn''t help.  There is no element of finding anything.  If you were in an eatery the duck would have never made it out of the kitchen.  But the duck, to me, sorry, just doesn''t cut it.  It would never be anything even remotely plausible in any eatery.<br/> <br/>Technicals: 6<br/>Challenge: X</td>', 'Technically this is a good shot - nice and crisp, well composed and excellent color control.  The lighting is well done and the perspective is good as well.  However, if you had used a real hair or had a bug floating in the soup or even the spoon with soup and the hair/bug in it THAT would be unexpected.  Also, with the spoon off to the side and clean (as in obviously not used yet) doesn''t help.  There is no element of finding anything.  If you were in an eatery the duck would have never made it out of the kitchen.  But the duck, to me, sorry, just doesn''t cut it.  It would never be anything even remotely plausible in any eatery. Technicals: 6Challenge: X', '2006-06-09 14:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
