(2505200, 343430, 2158, '<td valign="top">Actually I kind of like the effect.  <br/> <br/>Reminds me of an article I saw in a magazine about someone whose camera fell in water.  After drying it out he has consistently got similar results to this.  I''d love to be able to do it, but don''t want to take risks with even my less valuable equipment.</td>', 'Actually I kind of like the effect.   Reminds me of an article I saw in a magazine about someone whose camera fell in water.  After drying it out he has consistently got similar results to this.  I''d love to be able to do it, but don''t want to take risks with even my less valuable equipment.', '2006-06-10 19:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2505202, 343710, 56673, '<td valign="top">Insect porn?  Although not to my taste, this is some excellent close-up work. The pink background really adds a nice touch.</td>', 'Insect porn?  Although not to my taste, this is some excellent close-up work. The pink background really adds a nice touch.', '2006-06-10 19:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
