(2505215, 342090, 56673, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  great subject, good composition and color.  Seems a little overexposed, and picture size is a little small.</td>', 'Very nice capture.  great subject, good composition and color.  Seems a little overexposed, and picture size is a little small.', '2006-06-10 19:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
