(2506567, 341756, 23053, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling that this shot is overprocessed...it looks a bit harsh in the sharpness, and some of the colors seem to be glowing.  Aside from that, I like the composition, the crop, and the lighting.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I get the feeling that this shot is overprocessed...it looks a bit harsh in the sharpness, and some of the colors seem to be glowing.  Aside from that, I like the composition, the crop, and the lighting.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-06-11 11:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506568, 341756, 15256, '<td valign="top">where is the unexpected find???</td>', 'where is the unexpected find???', '2006-06-11 11:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506584, 344502, 23053, '<td valign="top">...and some voyeuristic ants, to boot.  This is an interesting shot, but it is missing something that I just can''t put my finger on...maybe it''s the relative size of the subject, but I do understand that you need to show some of the cactus to give context.  I think that a different crop could have served this photo better than the one shown here.  Good luck this week...</td>', '...and some voyeuristic ants, to boot.  This is an interesting shot, but it is missing something that I just can''t put my finger on...maybe it''s the relative size of the subject, but I do understand that you need to show some of the cactus to give context.  I think that a different crop could have served this photo better than the one shown here.  Good luck this week...', '2006-06-11 12:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506589, 344063, 23053, '<td valign="top">Nice warm tone to your duotone.  The crop is interesting to me (how the knuckles on the left hand were cut off) but it works well.  The sharpness is just right, being detailed without being harsh.  Good work and good luck.</td>', 'Nice warm tone to your duotone.  The crop is interesting to me (how the knuckles on the left hand were cut off) but it works well.  The sharpness is just right, being detailed without being harsh.  Good work and good luck.', '2006-06-11 12:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506592, 341539, 23053, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the church oriented in such a way that it doesn''t fall directly behind the rose. Also, the other rose poking its head into the frame is slightly distracting as is...fully in or fully out could be more effective.  If you reshoot this, stepping just a tad to the left, the church and the other rose will both be in the shot, but in a different way that might be nice.  Good luck this week and in the future.</td>', 'I''d like to see the church oriented in such a way that it doesn''t fall directly behind the rose. Also, the other rose poking its head into the frame is slightly distracting as is...fully in or fully out could be more effective.  If you reshoot this, stepping just a tad to the left, the church and the other rose will both be in the shot, but in a different way that might be nice.  Good luck this week and in the future.', '2006-06-11 12:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506593, 342022, 23053, '<td valign="top">No pun here, but good eye.  Composition is nice, and a wise move keeping this in color...B&amp;W would have surely killed the impact.  Well, good luck to you...this has the stink of a high score all over it.</td>', 'No pun here, but good eye.  Composition is nice, and a wise move keeping this in color...B&W would have surely killed the impact.  Well, good luck to you...this has the stink of a high score all over it.', '2006-06-11 12:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506596, 343877, 23053, '<td valign="top">Nice composition here, and a good photojournalism feel.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice composition here, and a good photojournalism feel.  Good luck.', '2006-06-11 12:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
