(2506988, 343986, 31133, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge well and I like that you went for black &amp; white here. The left hand is a little blown, but converting to b&amp;w has helped you with that. Clever title and nice comp.</td>', 'Fits the challenge well and I like that you went for black & white here. The left hand is a little blown, but converting to b&w has helped you with that. Clever title and nice comp.', '2006-06-11 18:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506991, 343710, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is a find! Not crazy about the pink, but boy oh boy, the technicals are nice. Love that flower / leaf thing at the bottom. It''s got great colors. I''m interested in hearing how you managed this shot. Good job!</td>', 'Wow, that is a find! Not crazy about the pink, but boy oh boy, the technicals are nice. Love that flower / leaf thing at the bottom. It''s got great colors. I''m interested in hearing how you managed this shot. Good job!', '2006-06-11 18:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2506996, 344378, 31133, '<td valign="top">HAHA Hahaha, really funny! Love the ciggie and tattoo ... jeeze, I guess I love the whole thing: baby''s hand, those slippers, the note. Hope you do well.</td>', 'HAHA Hahaha, really funny! Love the ciggie and tattoo ... jeeze, I guess I love the whole thing: baby''s hand, those slippers, the note. Hope you do well.', '2006-06-11 18:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2507000, 343722, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like the wide angle and the colors. The horses are a little too dark, though. If they were completely dark, it might work. The lines of the fence are nice, too.</td>', 'I like the wide angle and the colors. The horses are a little too dark, though. If they were completely dark, it might work. The lines of the fence are nice, too.', '2006-06-11 18:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2507005, 342659, 31133, '<td valign="top">WOW, what incredible detail! This is really an amazing catch. I hope you are very proud of this - you deserve to be! I love those spots and those downy feathers in its face. 10!</td>', 'WOW, what incredible detail! This is really an amazing catch. I hope you are very proud of this - you deserve to be! I love those spots and those downy feathers in its face. 10!', '2006-06-11 18:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2507012, 343965, 31133, '<td valign="top">It''s probably a very interesting fossil, and the focus sure is good. Still, there are a couple of things that are keeping me from giving it a good score. The straight-on view and close crop makes it fairly uninteresting to me, since I wasn''t there to see it in person. The surroundings might be interesting to see, to get the museum context, or maybe a different angle would add a little excitement. Finally, for dpc, it''s always a good idea to try and make one side the full 640 pixels that you are allowed. Hope this helps a little. Keep shooting!</td>', 'It''s probably a very interesting fossil, and the focus sure is good. Still, there are a couple of things that are keeping me from giving it a good score. The straight-on view and close crop makes it fairly uninteresting to me, since I wasn''t there to see it in person. The surroundings might be interesting to see, to get the museum context, or maybe a different angle would add a little excitement. Finally, for dpc, it''s always a good idea to try and make one side the full 640 pixels that you are allowed. Hope this helps a little. Keep shooting!', '2006-06-11 18:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2507023, 344495, 31133, '<td valign="top">That''s kind of cool. I''d like to see a bit more depth in the clouds / sky - might be good with levels and curves in Photoshop if you''ve got it. If not, then possibly another photo processing program to give the sky a bit more interest. I like the simplicity of this shot a lot. I like the way you''ve got the entire tree in, with the empty space at top.</td>', 'That''s kind of cool. I''d like to see a bit more depth in the clouds / sky - might be good with levels and curves in Photoshop if you''ve got it. If not, then possibly another photo processing program to give the sky a bit more interest. I like the simplicity of this shot a lot. I like the way you''ve got the entire tree in, with the empty space at top.', '2006-06-11 18:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
