(2509261, 343877, 54778, '<td valign="top">Ouch, a sad scene to find. You have good composition and I believe you can make this pic better. Firstly try it out as B/w with the fireman slightly sepia/ yellow coloured and try and bring out the blue of the smoke. I''m sure it''ll look even more fab</td>', 'Ouch, a sad scene to find. You have good composition and I believe you can make this pic better. Firstly try it out as B/w with the fireman slightly sepia/ yellow coloured and try and bring out the blue of the smoke. I''m sure it''ll look even more fab', '2006-06-12 12:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
