(2509277, 343800, 15204, '<td valign="top">You captured a nice moment between the two boys here.  I love the eylashes on the older brother.  It looks like you used your on camera flash here.  Flash is awfully harsh and flat light here.  Try turning it off and increasing your ISO or opening your aperature to take the shot with jsut the ambient light.</td>', 'You captured a nice moment between the two boys here.  I love the eylashes on the older brother.  It looks like you used your on camera flash here.  Flash is awfully harsh and flat light here.  Try turning it off and increasing your ISO or opening your aperature to take the shot with jsut the ambient light.', '2006-06-12 12:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
