(2512226, 344508, 35947, '<td valign="top">Wish the bottom 2 weren''t in the shot but otherwise a great catch!  9</td>', 'Wish the bottom 2 weren''t in the shot but otherwise a great catch!  9', '2006-06-13 09:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512426, 343183, 47704, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this has to do with "unexpected find" but it''s an amazing picture.  Please do a post-challenge post to explain your lighting and processing.  I love the texture.  I''m giving it a 9 even though I don''t understand the relevance.  Just because it''s an outstanding pic.</td>', 'I have no idea what this has to do with "unexpected find" but it''s an amazing picture.  Please do a post-challenge post to explain your lighting and processing.  I love the texture.  I''m giving it a 9 even though I don''t understand the relevance.  Just because it''s an outstanding pic.', '2006-06-13 11:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512439, 344396, 54778, '<td valign="top">Nice catch.. and I''m sure you can make it better.. Crop it up with an angle.. get rid of the harsh light from the sun..and experiment with the colours a bit. Make the contrast between the diff cars more by either burning a but and put a nice black border to complement it all.. I make that sound so easy don''t I...:)</td>', 'Nice catch.. and I''m sure you can make it better.. Crop it up with an angle.. get rid of the harsh light from the sun..and experiment with the colours a bit. Make the contrast between the diff cars more by either burning a but and put a nice black border to complement it all.. I make that sound so easy don''t I...:)', '2006-06-13 11:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512457, 341481, 47704, '<td valign="top">Looks horribly OOF.</td>', 'Looks horribly OOF.', '2006-06-13 11:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512484, 343549, 29269, '<td valign="top">Great point of view, and even more gross than mine! Extra point for that! Hate the blown left side, though. Could have done much better if you paid more attention to the harsh lighting, perhaps using a flash to illuminate the turd some more?</td>', 'Great point of view, and even more gross than mine! Extra point for that! Hate the blown left side, though. Could have done much better if you paid more attention to the harsh lighting, perhaps using a flash to illuminate the turd some more?', '2006-06-13 11:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512486, 344038, 29269, '<td valign="top">This would fit a desolation challenge much better! Strong image, but not sure how well it fits this category.</td>', 'This would fit a desolation challenge much better! Strong image, but not sure how well it fits this category.', '2006-06-13 11:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512571, 343948, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice but I would have liked it even better if the backround were out of focus, it´s pulling too much at my attention that should be focused solely on the bubble.  Nice shot anyway, gave it a 6.</td>', 'Nice but I would have liked it even better if the backround were out of focus, it´s pulling too much at my attention that should be focused solely on the bubble.  Nice shot anyway, gave it a 6.', '2006-06-13 12:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512582, 344329, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but in my opinion this is taken during the wrong time of day, the strong shadow that is across the landscape is too dark, this would have worked better if it were taken during the time of day none of it were in shadow or around sunset/sunrise where the shadows are softer.  Still a nice shot, don´t get me wrong.  Gave it a 6.</td>', 'Sorry but in my opinion this is taken during the wrong time of day, the strong shadow that is across the landscape is too dark, this would have worked better if it were taken during the time of day none of it were in shadow or around sunset/sunrise where the shadows are softer.  Still a nice shot, don´t get me wrong.  Gave it a 6.', '2006-06-13 12:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512594, 341221, 29269, '<td valign="top">What a cool image! <br/>I would have scored this with a 10 in a number of challenges, but this time it feels like it just does not belong here... points off for that but- adding as a favorite.</td>', 'What a cool image! I would have scored this with a 10 in a number of challenges, but this time it feels like it just does not belong here... points off for that but- adding as a favorite.', '2006-06-13 12:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512596, 344495, 29269, '<td valign="top">This is just excellent. I can really say: "What a find!"</td>', 'This is just excellent. I can really say: "What a find!"', '2006-06-13 12:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512604, 344396, 29269, '<td valign="top">Ha! This is a nice find. Compositionally, it feels like it could have been tilted more, (on purpose, I''m not saying that it is crooked or anything), to balance it.</td>', 'Ha! This is a nice find. Compositionally, it feels like it could have been tilted more, (on purpose, I''m not saying that it is crooked or anything), to balance it.', '2006-06-13 12:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512617, 343931, 27482, '<td valign="top">Somehow the mood in this picture is wrong for a restaurant, something to do with the backround and lighting that makes me 99% sure you took this in your livingroom but that´s just nitpicking :)  Nice shot and excellent idea, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Somehow the mood in this picture is wrong for a restaurant, something to do with the backround and lighting that makes me 99% sure you took this in your livingroom but that´s just nitpicking :)  Nice shot and excellent idea, gave it a 7.', '2006-06-13 12:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512621, 344088, 27482, '<td valign="top">This shot would have been great if it had been in focus.</td>', 'This shot would have been great if it had been in focus.', '2006-06-13 12:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512627, 342659, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice work technically speaking, love the clarity and sharpness.  However, just gave this a 6 as I don´t really think it hit´s the challenge dead on without the title but like I said, well done on the techicals.</td>', 'Nice work technically speaking, love the clarity and sharpness.  However, just gave this a 6 as I don´t really think it hit´s the challenge dead on without the title but like I said, well done on the techicals.', '2006-06-13 12:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512631, 342596, 27482, '<td valign="top">Normally I hate big frames like this but here it complements the shot in my opinion.  Also love the coloring in the shot, this would look great up on a wall with the same framing going on.</td>', 'Normally I hate big frames like this but here it complements the shot in my opinion.  Also love the coloring in the shot, this would look great up on a wall with the same framing going on.', '2006-06-13 12:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512636, 343931, 55767, '<td valign="top">Ewwwwwwww ... GROSS!</td>', 'Ewwwwwwww ... GROSS!', '2006-06-13 12:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512713, 342682, 28471, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot of lightning.  I have picked this as top ten.  Composition is good.  Nice depth of field.  It is good to see you didn''t just open up the apeture wide and hope for a sharp photo.  Good job.</td>', 'Excellent shot of lightning.  I have picked this as top ten.  Composition is good.  Nice depth of field.  It is good to see you didn''t just open up the apeture wide and hope for a sharp photo.  Good job.', '2006-06-13 13:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512720, 344063, 28471, '<td valign="top">Excellent job with your toning and conversion to a duotone image.  Composition wise:  Good job with following the rule of thirds.  The exposure is spot as well.</td>', 'Excellent job with your toning and conversion to a duotone image.  Composition wise:  Good job with following the rule of thirds.  The exposure is spot as well.', '2006-06-13 13:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512722, 343604, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice tones in it, especially in the wood.  Gotta be careful not to blow the hightlights thoug as you do in part of the cat´s fur, not bothering me in the least, just thought I´d point it out to you in case you hadn´t noticed.  Anyway, like this shot, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Nice tones in it, especially in the wood.  Gotta be careful not to blow the hightlights thoug as you do in part of the cat´s fur, not bothering me in the least, just thought I´d point it out to you in case you hadn´t noticed.  Anyway, like this shot, gave it a 7.', '2006-06-13 13:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512723, 341539, 40546, '<td valign="top">I think I''d have liked this photo more if you had used more of the church in the background.</td>', 'I think I''d have liked this photo more if you had used more of the church in the background.', '2006-06-13 13:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512726, 344460, 28471, '<td valign="top">Excellent job isolating your subject.  In this challenge I would have never thought that I would vote a picture of a mushroom as being top ten but you have done an outstanding job here.</td>', 'Excellent job isolating your subject.  In this challenge I would have never thought that I would vote a picture of a mushroom as being top ten but you have done an outstanding job here.', '2006-06-13 13:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512727, 343101, 27482, '<td valign="top">I kindof wished the eye of the fish was in as good a focus as the spikes on top of the head, the shot would have worked much better that way.</td>', 'I kindof wished the eye of the fish was in as good a focus as the spikes on top of the head, the shot would have worked much better that way.', '2006-06-13 13:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512735, 342242, 27482, '<td valign="top">I think you could have composed this better, it´s way to central, next time, try composing shots like this according to the rule of thirds, having the foxes up in the left corner, trust me, it would look so much better.  Nice find though and exposure, gave it a 5.</td>', 'I think you could have composed this better, it´s way to central, next time, try composing shots like this according to the rule of thirds, having the foxes up in the left corner, trust me, it would look so much better.  Nice find though and exposure, gave it a 5.', '2006-06-13 13:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512823, 342056, 27482, '<td valign="top">Kindof strongly dislike you cut half his head off like that, this would have been a much stronger shot with all of it in the frame.</td>', 'Kindof strongly dislike you cut half his head off like that, this would have been a much stronger shot with all of it in the frame.', '2006-06-13 13:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512844, 343549, 48268, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like this picture in this challenge, but it''s a great pic!</td>', 'I''m not sure I like this picture in this challenge, but it''s a great pic!', '2006-06-13 13:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512980, 343679, 27482, '<td valign="top">Haha, what a great find!  I can´t imagine why noone would dare sit next to it, hehe :)  Maybe a tad too dark for my taste but nothing that is hurting the shot.  7 from me!</td>', 'Haha, what a great find!  I can´t imagine why noone would dare sit next to it, hehe :)  Maybe a tad too dark for my taste but nothing that is hurting the shot.  7 from me!', '2006-06-13 14:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2512987, 342099, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but a bit too monotone for my taste, the dead birt completely blends in with the backround and it´s hard to make out, no one part of this photo that stands out also and that is hurting it in my opinion.  Not a bad shot though at all, got a 5 from me.</td>', 'Sorry but a bit too monotone for my taste, the dead birt completely blends in with the backround and it´s hard to make out, no one part of this photo that stands out also and that is hurting it in my opinion.  Not a bad shot though at all, got a 5 from me.', '2006-06-13 14:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
