(2513509, 344346, 36371, '<td valign="top">Nice dof. Need a little more detail in the bird. Very nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice dof. Need a little more detail in the bird. Very nice lighting.', '2006-06-13 17:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513512, 344460, 36371, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and light. Good perspective. 8</td>', 'Nice detail and light. Good perspective. 8', '2006-06-13 17:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513514, 342719, 36371, '<td valign="top">The bee needs to be more in focus. Nice light and DOF.</td>', 'The bee needs to be more in focus. Nice light and DOF.', '2006-06-13 17:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513521, 341221, 36371, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that  he''s looking right at you! Great catch! You are a brave soul. Have to give you extra for bravery!</td>', 'I like the fact that  he''s looking right at you! Great catch! You are a brave soul. Have to give you extra for bravery!', '2006-06-13 17:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513531, 342381, 36371, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Too bad you had to force down all those Twinkies... (obviously Twinkies WERE harmed in the making of this photo op.)  9</td>', 'Very nice! Too bad you had to force down all those Twinkies... (obviously Twinkies WERE harmed in the making of this photo op.)  9', '2006-06-13 17:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513543, 340839, 36371, '<td valign="top">Gotta give you points for cuteness!</td>', 'Gotta give you points for cuteness!', '2006-06-13 18:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513548, 344251, 46870, '<td valign="top">very funny</td>', 'very funny', '2006-06-13 18:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513549, 344508, 36371, '<td valign="top">I have NEVER seen that many stingrays at one time! This is an amazing shot! Great lighting and detail! 10!!<br/>Hope you put where this aquarium is in your profile. If this doesn''t win the blue.....it will be a shame!<br/>Thanks for sharing!!</td>', 'I have NEVER seen that many stingrays at one time! This is an amazing shot! Great lighting and detail! 10!!Hope you put where this aquarium is in your profile. If this doesn''t win the blue.....it will be a shame!Thanks for sharing!!', '2006-06-13 18:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513552, 344480, 29269, '<td valign="top">Great find. However, technically, it should have been a) sharper and b) cropped more tightly, and less centered. The boulder on the left had no business being in the photo, it is only a distraction.</td>', 'Great find. However, technically, it should have been a) sharper and b) cropped more tightly, and less centered. The boulder on the left had no business being in the photo, it is only a distraction.', '2006-06-13 18:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513559, 344512, 46870, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2006-06-13 18:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513616, 342596, 46314, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this fits the theme, but I liked the shape and colour.</td>', 'Not sure how this fits the theme, but I liked the shape and colour.', '2006-06-13 18:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513625, 344508, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great shot. A pity about the two heads in the foreground that mar the composition.<br/>The choice of black and white was a clever one, since the various groupings of fish create bands of tone (tightly grouped lower fish, one large shark and looser group of rays above) that probably wouldn''t be revealed as easily in colour. Plus the silhouette of the viewers at the bottom of the tank is strengthened without colour.</td>', 'Great shot. A pity about the two heads in the foreground that mar the composition.The choice of black and white was a clever one, since the various groupings of fish create bands of tone (tightly grouped lower fish, one large shark and looser group of rays above) that probably wouldn''t be revealed as easily in colour. Plus the silhouette of the viewers at the bottom of the tank is strengthened without colour.', '2006-06-13 18:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513637, 344448, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Vivid colour in bands across the frame - such a strong composition.</td>', 'Great photo. Vivid colour in bands across the frame - such a strong composition.', '2006-06-13 18:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513640, 343395, 46314, '<td valign="top">Funny, but seems a bit busy. The black and white doesn''t help. The ducky gets a bit lost in all of it.</td>', 'Funny, but seems a bit busy. The black and white doesn''t help. The ducky gets a bit lost in all of it.', '2006-06-13 18:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513643, 343722, 46314, '<td valign="top">I think the composition would have been stronger if you''d shot from a higher angle, to incorporate the horizon, and not have it hidden behind the bar of the fence, and also if you''d levelled the shot so that fence ran straight across the frame.<br/>Nice colour. Like the strong contrast of the fence.</td>', 'I think the composition would have been stronger if you''d shot from a higher angle, to incorporate the horizon, and not have it hidden behind the bar of the fence, and also if you''d levelled the shot so that fence ran straight across the frame.Nice colour. Like the strong contrast of the fence.', '2006-06-13 18:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513645, 343190, 46314, '<td valign="top">Another pretty lizard. I like the colour of the rocks as a contrast to the green. But was it an unexpected find? Or did you place him there...</td>', 'Another pretty lizard. I like the colour of the rocks as a contrast to the green. But was it an unexpected find? Or did you place him there...', '2006-06-13 18:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513652, 344329, 46314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful vista. A pity that the shadow de-emphasises the road a bit. Maybe shot at another time of day might get more light on the road.</td>', 'Beautiful vista. A pity that the shadow de-emphasises the road a bit. Maybe shot at another time of day might get more light on the road.', '2006-06-13 18:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513661, 342935, 46314, '<td valign="top">Composition is a touch cluttered - the netting in the back and the flower pot spoil it a bit. A wider aperture and less depth of field, or using long telephoto if you''re stuck with a digital compact, could have isolated the subject better.</td>', 'Composition is a touch cluttered - the netting in the back and the flower pot spoil it a bit. A wider aperture and less depth of field, or using long telephoto if you''re stuck with a digital compact, could have isolated the subject better.', '2006-06-13 19:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513666, 340839, 46314, '<td valign="top">Fits the theme well. Could have cropped that top corner of colour off maybe - it''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'Fits the theme well. Could have cropped that top corner of colour off maybe - it''s a bit distracting.', '2006-06-13 19:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513670, 342480, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Like the smooth tone of the plastic bowl that compliments the out of focus background. Were the water droplets necessary?</td>', 'Nice shot. Like the smooth tone of the plastic bowl that compliments the out of focus background. Were the water droplets necessary?', '2006-06-13 19:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513671, 344003, 46314, '<td valign="top">Humourous. Nice colour. I might have put the spoon at an angle. It looks a bit awkward hanging straight off the side there.</td>', 'Humourous. Nice colour. I might have put the spoon at an angle. It looks a bit awkward hanging straight off the side there.', '2006-06-13 19:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513676, 344451, 46314, '<td valign="top">Good photo. Love the colour and tone. The pig skin almost seems luminous.</td>', 'Good photo. Love the colour and tone. The pig skin almost seems luminous.', '2006-06-13 19:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513690, 344088, 46314, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful. The muted background colours compliment the subject so well. Could''ve simplified the composition further by cropping off the vertical stalk, but either way, an exquisite shot.</td>', 'Simply beautiful. The muted background colours compliment the subject so well. Could''ve simplified the composition further by cropping off the vertical stalk, but either way, an exquisite shot.', '2006-06-13 19:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513696, 344289, 46314, '<td valign="top">What was unexpected? The car, or the landscape? Nice lines running vertically through the frame (including the pylons), and the pinkisnness of the soil complements the red car in a way.</td>', 'What was unexpected? The car, or the landscape? Nice lines running vertically through the frame (including the pylons), and the pinkisnness of the soil complements the red car in a way.', '2006-06-13 19:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513699, 342294, 46314, '<td valign="top">Dark corner in the bottom right is distracting, especially since it matches the tone of the subject. I still like the photo though.</td>', 'Dark corner in the bottom right is distracting, especially since it matches the tone of the subject. I still like the photo though.', '2006-06-13 19:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513709, 344217, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and composition, but needed to be in focus.</td>', 'Nice colour and composition, but needed to be in focus.', '2006-06-13 19:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513717, 343949, 46314, '<td valign="top">Needed more contrast to bring out the depth of tone here, and would have benefited from straightening the door frame to vertical.</td>', 'Needed more contrast to bring out the depth of tone here, and would have benefited from straightening the door frame to vertical.', '2006-06-13 19:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513721, 344251, 46314, '<td valign="top">Bizarre..</td>', 'Bizarre..', '2006-06-13 19:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513734, 342834, 46314, '<td valign="top">Beats the ol'' ring-in-the-champagne-glass trick... Did she say yes? ;-)</td>', 'Beats the ol'' ring-in-the-champagne-glass trick... Did she say yes? ;-)', '2006-06-13 19:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513737, 343417, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette. A samurai?</td>', 'Great silhouette. A samurai?', '2006-06-13 19:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513742, 341548, 46314, '<td valign="top">Unfortunate that the sky got blown out. Love the reflections.</td>', 'Unfortunate that the sky got blown out. Love the reflections.', '2006-06-13 19:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513746, 344365, 46314, '<td valign="top">I''m never a fan of borders, but I actually liked this one. It compliments the strip on which the ship''s name is painted, and it makes the shot reminiscent of the old sailboat paintings you often see in pubs. <br/>However, it needed to be in focus.</td>', 'I''m never a fan of borders, but I actually liked this one. It compliments the strip on which the ship''s name is painted, and it makes the shot reminiscent of the old sailboat paintings you often see in pubs. However, it needed to be in focus.', '2006-06-13 19:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513755, 340968, 46314, '<td valign="top">Composition needs improvement. Subject not allowed to dominate the frame, and as a result, the shot lacks impact. Maybe you could have done more by filling the frame with the building, and trying to capture the reflection of the clouds in its windows.</td>', 'Composition needs improvement. Subject not allowed to dominate the frame, and as a result, the shot lacks impact. Maybe you could have done more by filling the frame with the building, and trying to capture the reflection of the clouds in its windows.', '2006-06-13 19:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513756, 343561, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Vivid colour, and nice balanced composition - reflections are great for that.</td>', 'Great shot. Vivid colour, and nice balanced composition - reflections are great for that.', '2006-06-13 19:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513759, 342942, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice. The reflections on the water are striking. The foreground is a bit distracting though, and the shot could have been levelled to impact more (the bridge and it''s reflections parallel with the edge of the frame)</td>', 'Nice. The reflections on the water are striking. The foreground is a bit distracting though, and the shot could have been levelled to impact more (the bridge and it''s reflections parallel with the edge of the frame)', '2006-06-13 19:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513764, 344378, 46314, '<td valign="top">I like the pose of the woman. Even without seeing her face, I can sense the surprise/shock on her face at the find. But perhaps the entire basket should be in focus, instead of the lady, since it is the basket that is the subject, isn''t it? I think that might have made the image stronger.</td>', 'I like the pose of the woman. Even without seeing her face, I can sense the surprise/shock on her face at the find. But perhaps the entire basket should be in focus, instead of the lady, since it is the basket that is the subject, isn''t it? I think that might have made the image stronger.', '2006-06-13 19:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513773, 343019, 46314, '<td valign="top">Just a matter of taste, but I would have liked this image more grainy - would give it a gritty, realistic feel maybe. I still like the image as it is, but maybe you should try out a grain/noise filter to see if it works like that?</td>', 'Just a matter of taste, but I would have liked this image more grainy - would give it a gritty, realistic feel maybe. I still like the image as it is, but maybe you should try out a grain/noise filter to see if it works like that?', '2006-06-13 19:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513776, 343710, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great colour.</td>', 'Great colour.', '2006-06-13 19:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513779, 343936, 46314, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit more white in the cross to punch it up a bit (seems to be a bit of a colour cast reflecting off the sand), but still a striking image.</td>', 'Needs a bit more white in the cross to punch it up a bit (seems to be a bit of a colour cast reflecting off the sand), but still a striking image.', '2006-06-13 19:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513791, 344456, 46314, '<td valign="top">Needed sharper focus. One of the most beautiful butterflies I''ve ever seen though.</td>', 'Needed sharper focus. One of the most beautiful butterflies I''ve ever seen though.', '2006-06-13 19:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513792, 343099, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. And well done to the models for not ruining the long exposure.</td>', 'Nice shot. And well done to the models for not ruining the long exposure.', '2006-06-13 19:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513793, 342682, 46314, '<td valign="top">Wow. It looks like it''s coming right out at you.</td>', 'Wow. It looks like it''s coming right out at you.', '2006-06-13 19:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513796, 344177, 46314, '<td valign="top">Love the block shapes and the parallel lines. It accentuates the movement of the blocks falling over. The exposure is great - wide range of tone in the shot. And the green grass growing on top is just the right amount of colour.</td>', 'Love the block shapes and the parallel lines. It accentuates the movement of the blocks falling over. The exposure is great - wide range of tone in the shot. And the green grass growing on top is just the right amount of colour.', '2006-06-13 19:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2513797, 344254, 46314, '<td valign="top">Macabre. But funny.</td>', 'Macabre. But funny.', '2006-06-13 19:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2514057, 340839, 42615, '<td valign="top">surprise.....I hope you really did ''find'' her there....my Spooky has the most unusual hiding spots...but I''ll make sure she doesn''t get this for an idea.<br/>Nice capture</td>', 'surprise.....I hope you really did ''find'' her there....my Spooky has the most unusual hiding spots...but I''ll make sure she doesn''t get this for an idea.Nice capture', '2006-06-13 22:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
