(2514591, 344508, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wow, Wow, Wow!  I didn''t get a chance to look at this challenge but I''m so glad this won a ribbon, because I would be kicking myself for missing this.  What I want to know is how long you had to sit there until this fantastic scene presented itself so wonderfully to you?  I love this aquarium and now will have to go back and plant myself in this very spot to see if I could be so lucky as to get half a good a shot as this one.  Congrats on your blue ribbon and into my favorites this goes!</td>', 'Wow, Wow, Wow!  I didn''t get a chance to look at this challenge but I''m so glad this won a ribbon, because I would be kicking myself for missing this.  What I want to know is how long you had to sit there until this fantastic scene presented itself so wonderfully to you?  I love this aquarium and now will have to go back and plant myself in this very spot to see if I could be so lucky as to get half a good a shot as this one.  Congrats on your blue ribbon and into my favorites this goes!', '2006-06-14 01:13:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2514599, 344508, 15497, '<td valign="top">Terrific! Simply breathtaking! Light is perfect, and the composition works so well. I''d be proud with a photo like this! Congratulations with the bluey!<br/></td>', 'Terrific! Simply breathtaking! Light is perfect, and the composition works so well. I''d be proud with a photo like this! Congratulations with the bluey!', '2006-06-14 01:14:25.000000', NULL, 0),
