(2515335, 340839, 51027, '<td valign="top">Wow! thanks guys. I''m honoured to do this well on my first challenge entry. I can''t wait to get out and shoot more. I think this website is great for jump starting a photographers creativity, and keeping her/him motivated to take better photos. <br/> <br/>A few minutes after I''d finished reading the challenge, our cat made her way down my Dad''s jacket sleeve. I''d taken a few shots before I realized that she''d actually got herself stuck inside. I would have set up a flash to get her face a little better, but she started to meow when she realized that she couldn''t get out by herself.</td>', 'Wow! thanks guys. I''m honoured to do this well on my first challenge entry. I can''t wait to get out and shoot more. I think this website is great for jump starting a photographers creativity, and keeping her/him motivated to take better photos.  A few minutes after I''d finished reading the challenge, our cat made her way down my Dad''s jacket sleeve. I''d taken a few shots before I realized that she''d actually got herself stuck inside. I would have set up a flash to get her face a little better, but she started to meow when she realized that she couldn''t get out by herself.', '2006-06-14 05:44:51.000000', NULL, 0),
