(2516028, 343033, 34192, '<td valign="top">In a challenge called unexpected find, I think many voters were looking for an image of an unexpected find (a thing).  So, I think your image was sometimes scored on the prejudices of the voters in their search for a thing rather than on the quality of the image. If I had voted this challenge, I would have given it a 6, maybe a 7 on second glance (maybe higher based on a curve).  Its well seen, well taken, well composed, and has a splash of humor.</td>', 'In a challenge called unexpected find, I think many voters were looking for an image of an unexpected find (a thing).  So, I think your image was sometimes scored on the prejudices of the voters in their search for a thing rather than on the quality of the image. If I had voted this challenge, I would have given it a 6, maybe a 7 on second glance (maybe higher based on a curve).  Its well seen, well taken, well composed, and has a splash of humor.', '2006-06-14 10:28:14.000000', NULL, 0),
