(2532450, 342449, 53598, '<td valign="top">Hi! This is called Turkey Vulture or Turkey Buzzard (told by its wing and bald naked red head). I am studying it. If it is possible, would you please send a high resolution picutre of this to me at diccidwp@ufl.edu? I am doing research on its flight model and in this picture its tail contract. If you are so kind to do so, please also let me know the wind condition when you took this picture. Thank you very much!!</td>', 'Hi! This is called Turkey Vulture or Turkey Buzzard (told by its wing and bald naked red head). I am studying it. If it is possible, would you please send a high resolution picutre of this to me at diccidwp@ufl.edu? I am doing research on its flight model and in this picture its tail contract. If you are so kind to do so, please also let me know the wind condition when you took this picture. Thank you very much!!', '2006-06-20 17:07:52.000000', NULL, 0),
