(2571227, 344495, 19670, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments!<br/>Unfortunately, just about a week later a storm blew over the plant. The owners righted it, but cut it down to about six feet tall. I would have liked to see if it would have produced flowers.<br/>Oh, and maybe it''s not a yucca...new information I received indcates it''s probably a Century Plant, or agave.<br/>And now it''s gone completely...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-04 10:14:46.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the comments!Unfortunately, just about a week later a storm blew over the plant. The owners righted it, but cut it down to about six feet tall. I would have liked to see if it would have produced flowers.Oh, and maybe it''s not a yucca...new information I received indcates it''s probably a Century Plant, or agave.And now it''s gone completely...', '2006-07-01 00:17:42.000000', '2006-08-04 11:14:46.000000', 0),
