(2620763, 343722, 34192, '<td valign="top">there is something ultimately cool about this.  I don''t know what it is yet, but I really like it.  I think the only improvement would be to lighten their faces just a hair so I can better see them.  You''re from ky.  You must have seen a thousand times men gathered at a fence, shooting the crap, watching cars drive by?  Horses do it too, don''t they.  That''s why I love this. :)</td>', 'there is something ultimately cool about this.  I don''t know what it is yet, but I really like it.  I think the only improvement would be to lighten their faces just a hair so I can better see them.  You''re from ky.  You must have seen a thousand times men gathered at a fence, shooting the crap, watching cars drive by?  Horses do it too, don''t they.  That''s why I love this. :)', '2006-07-13 23:50:20.000000', NULL, 0),
