(2938235, 343183, 50695, '<td valign="top">A Fan Killed at a David Cassidy Concert<br/> <br/>The mountain of your eyes,<br/>impassably beautiful,<br/>cannot distinguish me.<br/> <br/>I cannot imagine<br/>you could ever accept<br/>my kisses.<br/> <br/>In this way<br/>you are like dying,<br/>a crossing improvised<br/> <br/>in desperation,<br/>and only in darkness<br/>can I meet your gaze.<br/> <br/>Donald Zirilli<br/>12/27/99</td>', 'A Fan Killed at a David Cassidy Concert The mountain of your eyes,impassably beautiful,cannot distinguish me. I cannot imagineyou could ever acceptmy kisses. In this wayyou are like dying,a crossing improvised in desperation,and only in darknesscan I meet your gaze. Donald Zirilli12/27/99', '2006-10-17 23:59:54.000000', NULL, 0),
