(4418784, 344508, 81030, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bosborne:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jakemacriv:</b></div><hr/><i> i like it a lot but i think it would have been so much cooler if it didnt have those two kids in the foreground. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No..no..no.... It''s BECAUSE those people are there that makes this shot. It gives dimension and a reality of what it''s like there. Well done! I just KNEW you''d get the blue!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There are 5 people in the frame.  It would be much more impressive if there were only those 3 that are up against the glass. Then it would be like in a dream.  But still, awsome photo</td>', 'Originally posted by Bosborne: Originally posted by jakemacriv: i like it a lot but i think it would have been so much cooler if it didnt have those two kids in the foreground.   No..no..no.... It''s BECAUSE those people are there that makes this shot. It gives dimension and a reality of what it''s like there. Well done! I just KNEW you''d get the blue!!   There are 5 people in the frame.  It would be much more impressive if there were only those 3 that are up against the glass. Then it would be like in a dream.  But still, awsome photo', '2008-01-23 18:30:55.000000', NULL, 0),
